msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D6752372_D5F3_471E_98D5_15AEE4916343"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I just... ⟪k:1⟫wish to speak.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I would like to have a calm, rational conversation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Я просто... ⟪k:1⟫хочу поговорить.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Я бы хотел спокойно поговорить."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9638C178_0E3F_4DC1_85EA_F35CA7DE8F20
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6340a98f275456f719e159e78dcd5b0b4e234c66dd62b491442ce1b8646b344
