#: scenario3:scenario3_F6334980_B8FA_4AF8_8148_5FCF9A1122B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 342b9e59d19218446f8d3b450efae8ce87bb727e53a1d082b726b63dbf37b3d3
